# O'Nan's projective matrix model

The fixed carrier `ONan.Model` is generated in PGL(45,7) by the two explicit
ATLAS 45a matrices for 3.O'N. It has proved `Group` and `Finite` instances
and an explicit pair of noncommuting elements. See `MatrixModel.lean` for the
construction and `refs/original/onan/README.md` for source attribution.
